  "description": "Carving corners with razor-sharp precision is made easier and more effortless than ever thanks to the new 27.5-inch wheels Comp model. Tapered head tube, RockShox Recon Gold fork, front and rear thru-axles and Shimano Deore / XT components deliver a lightweight quality ride.\n2016 Haro FL Carbon 27.5 Series w/ tapered head tube, BB92 shell, 12mm rear Thru-Axle, Direct mount side-swing front derailleur\nRockShox Recon Gold TK 27.5in taper fork, 100mm travel, 15mm Thru Axle\nRitchey Comp Logic Zero Drop-In, tapered 1-1/8\"-1.5\" headset, w/ ACB sealed bearings\nFSA Comet Mega Exo 38/24t crankset & BB-CFM92/CZ Press Fit BB set\nShimano Deore front derailleur, Direct Mount / Side-swing\nShimano XT GS Shadow rear derailleur\nRitchey MTN 20mm riser handlebar\nRitchey WCS Trail Lock On grips\nKenda Honey Badger XC 27.5*2.05\" 60tpi tires\nWeinmann XC-180 Disc alloy double wall rims, Pivit alloy disc 28h hubs w/ cassette, Thru-Axle Front 15mm & Shimano Rear 12mm",
